(Bug #79 at its worst. `append` asked what KIND the name was before it
 asked whether the name was available yet, and both kind sets are filled
 by the whole-program pre-pass - so this walked straight past the
 availability check into codegen and SEGFAULTED on a list header that
 did not exist yet. Order first, kind second.)

append 1 to items.
